  "story": {
    "day": 82,
    "title": "Kaya's Sports Shopping Day",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya was an active seventh-grade student in two thousand twenty-two.",
      "Her parent took her to buy new sports gear for her track and field team.",
      "Kaya tried a third, then a fourth jogging suit.",
      "She also liked some fast running shorts for forty yen.",
      "\"Wow, these are fine!\" she said to them.",
      "She bought a funny bird sticker for twenty-one yen.",
      "She also saw a fifth-place and a sixth-place trophy.",
      "\"Hey, is this volleyball ours?\" she asked.",
      "Its price was two thousand thirty yen.",
      "She would learn a lot and spend time at home.",
      "Before her bath, she ate a taco and did not miss vacation.",
      "They live very close to the shop."
    ]
  }
